# "Target nonland permanent": Bot2's Island is refused as a target while Bot2's Ornithopter, the positive control, is a
# legal target and goes back to its owner's hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Echoing Truth
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Echoing Truth.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Island)
Bot1.Hand.Echoing Truth.Cast(Ornithopter)
